    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story of Noah</strong> is an exciting adventure for the whole family, inspired by one of the greatest stories from the Holy Scriptures.<br>Build the ark, save the animals, and survive the Great Flood together with Noah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Noah\u2019s family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ancient world\u00a0and meet characters from that time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food for yourself and the animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring all the animals into the ark and take care for them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a finale with the first rainbow, \u0430 symbol of hope and blessing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the mission God entrusted to Noah and save humanity and all living creatures from the flood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for children and parents \u2014 play together and discover the power of faith, patience, and care.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story of Noah</strong> is an exciting adventure for the whole family, inspired by one of the greatest stories from the Holy Scriptures.<br>Build the ark, save the animals, and survive the Great Flood together with Noah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Noah\u2019s family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ancient world\u00a0and meet characters from that time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food for yourself and the animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring all the animals into the ark and take care for them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a finale with the first rainbow, \u0430 symbol of hope and blessing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the mission God entrusted to Noah and save humanity and all living creatures from the flood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for children and parents \u2014 play together and discover the power of faith, patience, and care.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the captivating world of &quot;The Story of Noah&quot; \u2014 a journey for you and your children into ancient times and one of the most inspiring stories of the Holy Scriptures! Step into the role of Noah \u2014 the man chosen to build an ark and save his family and all animals from the great flood.",
